WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,008
Young Madam

2
00:00:01,008 --> 00:00:02,454
Mrs. Hou said

3
00:00:02,454 --> 00:00:04,480
Since you are married

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:07,662
The middle fee in this hospital will be handed over to you.

5
00:00:07,662 --> 00:00:10,555
This is the key to the prince's warehouse

6
00:00:10,555 --> 00:00:12,580
And the government’s account books

7
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:20,020
I have been dealing with abacus and account books since I was a child, and the accounts of the Marquis Mansion are not a problem for me.

8
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,690
Mammy, these are...

9
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:30,300
Madam, you see, this family's Xinhou Mansion and our Pingying Hou Mansion have been fighting in the court for more than ten years.

10
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:36,300
This British kungfu family is related by marriage to the noble concubine in the palace, and these other families may appear to be polite, but in fact they are full of evil intentions.

11
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:43,420
The prince has not been out for more than half a year, and now that you have come in, they naturally want to take the opportunity to make friends.

12
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:47,420
If you want to go, you can go. If you don't want to go, just refuse, don't force it.
